(2) Unloading.- In every factory, where unloading of ﬂ ammable liqueﬁ ed or compressed gas is carried on, the compressor used for unloading of ﬂ ammable liqueﬁ ed gases by means of a diﬀ erential pressure between the receiving and discharging

